## GitLab: rate limited without a key
GitLab rate limited the request for updated information. Add the GITLAB_TOKEN or GITLAB_PRIVATE_TOKEN API key to get larger rate limits.

## GitLab: rate limited with a key
GitLab rate limited the request for updated information. Try again in a few minutes.

